    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the complete Node.js solution at [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js).\n\nWhat it does:\n- Parses required flags: `--input <path>` and `--output <path>`\n- Rejects unknown/missing/duplicate arguments with exit code `1`\n- Reads the input file as bytes\n- Treats malformed UTF-8 as invalid input (exit `1`)\n- Computes:\n  - `lines` (spec-compliant newline semantics)\n  - `words` (split by exactly: space, tab, newline, carriage return, form feed, vertical tab)\n  - `characters` (byte count)\n  - `unique_words` (case-insensitive)\n  - `top_words` (up to 10, sorted by count desc then word asc)\n- Writes JSON output to the provided `--output` path\n- Uses only Node.js standard library, no external dependencies\n\nExit codes implemented:\n- `0` success\n- `1` invalid invocation or invalid input file\n- `2` unexpected internal error\n\nI also ran end-to-end checks for edge cases from the spec (empty file, no trailing newline, trailing newline, multiple newlines, case handling, punctuation, malformed UTF-8, bad args).",
